# Iframe — agent conventions

- Before repo audits or gap analysis, read `docs/AGENT_BRIEFING.md` (intentional design vs missing work).
- Before deploy or limit changes, read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE_NOTES.md`, and `docs/VERCEL.md`.
- RAG ingest, Pinecone, and `rag_api_gemini.py` live in sibling `../documentation-helper` — do not duplicate.
- Never commit secrets or put `RAG_SERVICE_SECRET` in client JS.
- Linux: prefer `python3` / `pipenv run` in documentation-helper; do not assume `python` on PATH.
- When the user should **test locally**, state restart needs explicitly: RAG changes → restart `pipenv run uvicorn rag_api:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000` in documentation-helper; **`.env` changes** → restart dev_server and/or uvicorn (env read at startup); embed-only JS → refresh browser. See `AGENTS.md` § Local test reminders.
